-- Canonical masked update (ex1). Twin of 001-canonical-masked-update.bqn.
-- The first sentence of the language. A world of six fighters: Nord marks who is one, TwoHanded is a skill, Gold is a purse. Left of the comma, who is selected; right of the comma, what happens to them.
-- The selection mask Nord ∧ TwoHanded>60 gates a masked add down the Gold column.
--! registry ../registries/001-canonical-masked-update.reg
--! expect gold = 1100 200 300 1400 500 600

Nord & TwoHanded > 60 , Gold += 1000
